    {
      "_key": "en",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "x668s9mud70j",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Discovering "
            },
            {
              "_key": "9e4udtqwkjga",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "jfs9baq5np3s"
              ],
              "text": "Giza"
            },
            {
              "_key": "ygbkzocjev1r",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": A Cultural and Historical Adventure"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "jfs9baq5np3s",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58854",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000003",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "As an experienced travel writer with a deep affinity for Egypt’s rich heritage, I invite you to immerse yourself in the vibrant cultural tapestry of Giza, a city where history and modernity intertwine. Here are some of the major activities that promise to enrich your understanding and appreciation of this ancient land."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Unraveling the Secrets of Ancient Communication at The Egypt Papyrus Museum"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Dive into the heart of Egyptian "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000007"
              ],
              "text": "culture at the Egypt"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Papyrus Museum. This treasure trove is a celebration of the ancient Egyptians’ ingenuity in writing and record-keeping. Opt for a guided tour to uncover fascinating insights about the birthplace of "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000a"
              ],
              "text": "papyrus"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", the ancient precursor to paper. As a highlight, you may even find the perfect papyrus souvenir to carry a piece of Egyptian history back home."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/things-to-do-in-aswan/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/guide/aswan/things-to-do-in-aswan",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://www.britannica.com/topic/papyrus-writing-material",
              "newTab": true
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Exploring the Wonders at The Grand Egyptian Museum"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000014",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The Grand Egyptian Museum, colloquially known as GEM or the Giza Museum, is a monumental project partially open to the public. This architectural marvel, designed as a contemporary interpretation of a chamfered triangle, is on its way to becoming the world’s largest archaeological museum. The GEM aims to be the definitive destination for all artifacts of "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000011"
              ],
              "text": "ancient Egypt"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", encapsulated within a state-of-the-art facility boasting cutting-edge technologies, including immersive virtual reality experiences. Not just a treasure trove for adults, the museum also caters to younger audiences with a dedicated children’s section, making it a family-friendly destination. As a hub for scholarly and cultural exchange, the museum frequently hosts international conferences and exhibitions."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/temples-tombs-and-the-queens/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/blog/kodai-ejiputo-no-joo-tachi",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000016",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Experiencing Ancient Life at Dr. Ragab’s Pharaonic Village"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "For a truly unique experience, visit Dr. Ragab’s "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000018"
              ],
              "text": "Pharaonic"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Village. This immersive cultural center brings ancient Egypt to life with meticulous replicas of King Tutankhamun’s tomb, and an experiential village where visitors can step back in time to experience the daily life of ancient Egyptians. The village is also a haven for children, offering playful learning experiences, including interactive games like bumper cars. Beyond ancient history, the village periodically showcases photo exhibitions of more contemporary events, offering a rich, layered perspective on Egypt’s enduring legacy."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pharaonic_Village",
              "newTab": true
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "In Giza, every corner tells a story, and every experience deepens your connection to this land of timeless wonders. Whether you’re a history enthusiast, a cultural explorer, or a family seeking an educational adventure, Giza’s array of activities promises an unforgettable journey through the annals of one of the world’s most fascinating civilizations."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001e",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Giza-City-Trips-in-Egypt-2.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Image of the Great Sphinx of Giza with the Pyramids in the background under a clear blue sky"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "The enigmatic Sphinx, a timeless guardian of ancient Egypt"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001f",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/32.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Three ancient pyramids rising from the desert sands under a clear blue sky in Giza, Egypt"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "The Great Pyramids of Giza: A Testament to Ancient Wonders"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "es",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "fzieaor73imv",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Descubrir "
            },
            {
              "_key": "yltd4n9zgr1o",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "k7txapjper65"
              ],
              "text": "Guiza"
            },
            {
              "_key": "1u896kqmys3e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ": Una Aventura Cultural e Histórica"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "k7txapjper65",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58854",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Como experta escritora de viajes con una profunda afinidad por el rico patrimonio egipcio, te invito a sumergirte en el vibrante tapiz cultural de Guiza, una ciudad donde se entrelazan la historia y la modernidad."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " He aquí algunas de las principales actividades que prometen enriquecer tu comprensión y apreciación de esta antigua tierra."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000007",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Desentrañar los secretos de la comunicación antigua en el Museo del Papiro Egipcio"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Sumérgete en el corazón de la "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000009"
              ],
              "text": "cultura egipcia en el Museo del"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Papiro Egipcio."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Este tesoro es una celebración "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000e"
              ],
              "text": "del ingenio de los antiguos egipcios"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " para escribir y llevar registros."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Opta por una visita guiada para descubrir datos fascinantes sobre la cuna del "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000013"
              ],
              "text": "papiro"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", el antiguo precursor del papel."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Como punto culminante, puede que incluso encuentres el recuerdo de papiro perfecto para llevarte a casa un trozo de la "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000018"
              ],
              "text": "historia"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " egipcia."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/souq-bab-el-louk-el-mercado-fresco-de-el-cairo/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/souq-bab-el-louk-el-mercado-fresco-de-el-cairo",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
